# Guitar notes: small D-minor double-stops and single-note pickups; space is the groove. A firmer upper answer appears once.
# Guitar expression: short gates and softer offbeats use the recorded DI attack and round robins. No recorded palm-mute or slide is claimed.
# Bass notes: short root/octave answers around kick; drums keep a dry snare, soft hats and a deliberately empty fourth beat before landing.
song "Electric pocket" 112 4/4 Dm seed=97 tail=2 mood=balanced
